   "guide": "Client gives the project background below, in their own words.",
   "content": [
    {
     "text": "This Web Store is designed to allow new online store owners a quick and easy means to setup and perform sales and other core business over the internet. Version 1 is planned for implementation on a \"plug and play\" USB Key. Expandable with unique codes, the owners can purchase to expand the inventory.",
     "role": "background"
    }
   ]
  },
